    "Separate traces use eight generated outputs and no prepared native role counters. Timed full-model requests use 32 generated outputs. Trace intervals are not pure PCIe transfer time.",
    "The restored runtime has a different container wrapper; saved filesystem and locked dependencies are verified, including actual SGLang NCCL initialization.",
    "An initial focused-check setup used diagnostics with explicit Graph, which the API rejects. A later sequential-context fixture stalled during a second Gloo new_group construction, after all first-context route assertions passed. Independent process groups per top-k removed that setup interference; no timings from failed checks are accepted."
